      "dom_id": "step-q186825",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Given that $\\frac{4}{7}\\times 5=\\frac{\\,\\boxed{}}{7},$ the missing number is{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To multiply a fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction's numerator by the whole number and keep the denominator the same:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4\\times 5}{7}=\\frac{20}{7}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing number is $20.$",
